id: variable-fighter
name: Variable Fighter
talentCategory: weapon
prerequisites: Weapon Specialist
description: >
  You are skilled in the use of both Weapons and your fists or ki, and employ a style which utilizes both.
text: >
  Variable Fighter: You are skilled in the use of both Weapons and your fists or ki, and employ a style which utilizes both.
  –Prerequisites: Weapon Specialist
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are wielding a Weapon, increase the Strike Rolls of your Unarmed Attacks by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you hit an Opponent with an Unarmed Attack or an Armed Attack, increase the Wound Rolls of the other by 1(T) until the start of your next turn.

---

[passive]
# (1) A Weapon wielded: an Unarmed Attack's Strike (chat.mjs variableParts).
strike.unarmedWielding += 1(T);

# (2) An Opponent hit (the `hit-opponent` Moment): by an Unarmed Attack, your Armed Attacks' Wound 1(T); by an Armed one, your
# Unarmed Attacks' - till the start of your next turn (a mark each; chat.mjs variableFighter, variableParts). Automatic by
# default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/hit-opponent, 1/round, effect 2]
variableFighter();
